 expands every kit:generate region to what its command makes, or checks that it is

   --check       writes nothing, and fails naming every stale file

   --iterations  expands the named files <n> times instead of once

   <path>…       the files to expand, relative to the current directory; with none, every tracked
                 file and every untracked file git does not ignore, repeated until a pass changes
                 nothing


 kit generate
